Mathlib/Order/Monotone/Basic.lean:* `monotone_nat_of_le_succ`, `monotone_int_of_le_succ`: If `f : ℕ → α` or `f : ℤ → α` and
Mathlib/Order/Monotone/Basic.lean:* `antitone_nat_of_succ_le`, `antitone_int_of_succ_le`: If `f : ℕ → α` or `f : ℤ → α` and
Mathlib/Order/Monotone/Basic.lean:theorem monotone_nat_of_le_succ {f : ℕ → α} (hf : ∀ n, f n ≤ f (n + 1)) : Monotone f :=
Mathlib/Order/Monotone/Basic.lean:theorem antitone_nat_of_succ_le {f : ℕ → α} (hf : ∀ n, f (n + 1) ≤ f n) : Antitone f :=
Mathlib/Order/Monotone/Basic.lean:  @monotone_nat_of_le_succ αᵒᵈ _ _ hf
Mathlib/Order/Monotone/Basic.lean:  refine monotone_nat_of_le_succ fun n ↦ ?_
